# Server settings hold secrets: server-settings.json carries masterKey,
# discordAuth.botToken and the settings repo tokens; the build copies it into
# server-settings-base.json, and the server writes server-settings-dump.json and
# server-settings-merged.json next to it. No leading slash: they appear wherever
# a build or server directory sits.
server-settings.json
server-settings-base.json
server-settings-dump.json
server-settings-merged.json
